furinar (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release
  * MP3, WAV, FLAC, OGG/Vorbis, M4A support
  * Multiple folders as tabs
  * Synced lyrics via .lrc files
  * Light and dark themes
  * MPRIS media controls
  * Search/filter by title or artist

